## ADR-0001 … ADR-0015
See earlier entries: PixiJS renderer, fixed 60Hz sim, JSON content, door mats,
gesture-gated audio, pure engine modules, renderer-owned ambience, A* grid
pathfinding, seekers sharing the pathfinder, pure mini-game cores, top-down
